{"speciesId":298,"names":{"fr":"Azurill","es":"Azurill","en":"Azurill","ja":"ルリリ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"AZURILL spins its tail as if it were a lasso, then hurls it far. The momentum of the throw sends its body flying, too. Using this unique action, one of these POKéMON managed to hurl itself a record 33 feet."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"AZURILL’s tail is large and bouncy. It is packed full of the nutrients this POKéMON needs to grow. AZURILL can be seen bouncing and playing on its big, rubbery tail."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"Its tail, which is packed with nutrition, is very bouncy like a rubber ball. On sunny days they gather at the edge of water and splash about for fun."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It battles by flinging around its tail, which is bigger than its body. The tail is a flotation device in water."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It battles by flinging around its tail, which is bigger than its body. The tail is a flotation device in water."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"A Pokémon that lives by water. It moves quickly on land by bouncing on its big tail."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Its tail is filled with nutrients necessary for growth. It plays by bouncing on its tail."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Its tail bounces like a rubber ball. It flings that tail around to fight opponents bigger than itself."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Its tail is packed full of the nutrients it needs to grow."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Its tail is packed full of the nutrients it needs to grow."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Sa queue est plus rebondissante qu’une balle du même nom. C’est aussi une massue très puissante."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Its tail bounces like a rubber ball. It flings that tail around to fight opponents bigger than itself."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Sa queue est plus rebondissante qu’une balle du même nom. C’est aussi une massue très puissante."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Its tail bounces like a rubber ball. It flings that tail around to fight opponents bigger than itself."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It swings its large, nutrient-filled tail around to fight opponents bigger than itself."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It swings its large, nutrient-filled tail around to fight opponents bigger than itself."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Un Pokémon qui vit près de l’eau. Au sol, il se déplace rapidement en rebondissant sur sa grosse queue."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Vive cerca del agua. En la tierra se mueve muy rápido botando sobre su gran cola."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"A Pokémon that lives by water. It moves quickly on land by bouncing on its big tail."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"大きな 尻尾に 乗って 弾むと 地上では 速く 移動できる。 水辺で 暮らす ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il fait tournoyer sa queue, connue pour ses qualités nutritives, pour l’abattre comme une puissante massue sur l’ennemi."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Para hacer frente a oponentes más grandes que él, agita su gran cola, llena de nutrientes, de un lado a otro."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It swings its large, nutrient-filled tail around to fight opponents bigger than itself."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"栄養が つまった 大きな 尻尾を 振り回して 自分より 手強い 相手にも たちむかう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Azurill fait tournoyer sa queue comme un lasso et l’envoie si fort que le reste de son corps est également projeté. Le record de lancer de ce Pokémon est actuellement de 10 m."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Azurill enrolla la cola como si fuera un lazo y la despliega a continuación todo lo que puede. De esta forma, un Azurill llegó a lanzarse a sí mismo hasta 10 m."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Azurill spins its tail as if it were a lasso, then hurls it far. The momentum of the throw sends its body flying, too. Using this unique action, one of these Pokémon managed to hurl itself a record 33 feet."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"投げ縄の 要領で 尻尾を 振り回し 投げた ときの 力で 飛んでいく。 最高 １０メートル 飛んだ 記録が ある。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"La grande queue d’Azurill est élastique. Elle lui permet de stocker les nutriments nécessaires à sa croissance. Parfois, on voit Azurill s’amuser à rebondir sur sa queue élastique."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Azurill tiene una especie de pelota en la cola, que contiene los nutrientes necesarios para crecer. Es fácil ver a este Pokémon saltando y jugueteando sentado encima de la misma."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Azurill’s tail is large and bouncy. It is packed full of the nutrients this Pokémon needs to grow. Azurill can be seen bouncing and playing on its big, rubbery tail."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"尻尾には 成長する ために 必要な 栄養が たっぷり 詰まっているぞ。 弾力の ある 尻尾に 乗って 遊ぶ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"La boule située au bout de sa queue rebondit telle une balle de caoutchouc. Elle regorge des nutriments nécessaires à la croissance d’Azurill."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"La bola que tiene en la cola rebota como una pelota de goma y está repleta de los nutrientes que este Pokémon necesita para crecer."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"The ball on Azurill’s tail bounces like a rubber ball, and it’s full of the nutrients the Pokémon needs to grow."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"ゴムまりのように 弾む しっぽの 玉には 成長に 必要な 栄養が たっぷり 詰まっている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"C’est un Pokémon docile, mais si on l’énerve, il n’hésite pas à frapper en faisant tournoyer la grosse boule au bout de sa queue."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Es un Pokémon tranquilo, pero, si se le hace enfadar, atacará utilizando la enorme bola que tiene en la cola."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Although Azurill are normally docile, an angry one will swing around the big ball on its tail and try to smash its opponents."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"おとなしい ポケモンだが 怒ると しっぽの 大きな 玉を ぶんぶん 振りまわして 叩きつけてくるぞ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":298,"moves":[{"name":"slam","learns":[[5,"level-up",15],[5,"egg",0],[6,"level-up",15],[6,"egg",0],[7,"level-up",15],[7,"egg",0],[8,"level-up",15],[8,"egg",0],[9,"level-up",15],[9,"egg",0],[10,"level-up",15],[10,"egg",0],[11,"level-up",15],[11,"egg",0],[12,"level-up",15],[13,"level-up",15],[14,"level-up",20],[14,"egg",0],[15,"level-up",20],[15,"egg",0],[16,"level-up",20],[16,"egg",0],[17,"level-up",20],[17,"egg",0],[18,"level-up",20],[18,"egg",0],[20,"level-up",12],[23,"level-up",12],[23,"egg",0],[25,"level-up",12]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[10,"egg",0],[11,"egg",0],[13,"tutor",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[20,"machine",0],[23,"egg",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"tail-whip","learns":[[5,"level-up",6],[6,"level-up",6],[7,"level-up",6],[8,"level-up",7],[9,"level-up",7],[10,"level-up",7],[11,"level-up",7],[12,"level-up",6],[13,"level-up",6],[14,"level-up",2],[15,"level-up",2],[16,"level-up",2],[17,"level-up",2],[18,"level-up",2],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"sing","learns":[[5,"egg",0],[6,"egg",0],[7,"egg",0],[8,"egg",0],[9,"egg",0],[10,"egg",0],[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[20,"egg",0],[23,"egg",0],[25,"egg",0]]},{"name":"supersonic","learns":[[20,"egg",0],[23,"egg",0],[25,"egg",0]]},{"name":"water-gun","learns":[[5,"level-up",21],[6,"level-up",21